<title>MOLDOVA: MOLDOVAN LEU EDGED DOWN TO 4.6740 PER DOLLAR.</title>
<headline>MOLDOVAN LEU EDGED DOWN TO 4.6740 PER DOLLAR.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu edged down to 4.6780 to the dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange from 4.6740 on Thursday. </p>
<p>				    Jan 17	Jan 16</p>
<p> lei per dollar		 4.6780	4.6740</p>
<p> volume traded ($)	    220,000     570,000</p>
</text>
